# Any YC application draft, wherever it lands. Case-insensitive variants are
# listed explicitly because git patterns are case-sensitive on Linux/CI.
# The glob must survive a renamed draft: YC-SPRING-2027-APPLICATION.md slipped
# past YC-APPLICATION*.md on 2026-08-03 because the season landed mid-name.
YC*APPLICATION*.md
yc*application*.md
**/YC*APPLICATION*.md
**/yc*application*.md

# Playwright MCP scratch output (screenshots, snapshots, console logs)
.playwright-mcp/
.env*

# Agent worktrees (Workflow isolation: "worktree"). Removed automatically when
# unchanged, but a killed run can leave one holding a modified lockfile -- and an
# untracked directory here is one `git add -A` away from being committed.
.claude/worktrees/
